> Choose writes from the stage, even when alpha reaches an endpoint

The24 tensors have group counts1236,5,296,5,213,8,296,8. Their seeds, in group
order, are6401,6407,6413,6421,6427,6449,6451,6469. Dense maps use the native
Glorot initializer and zero biases; biased convolution kernels use normal(.02).
Each feature map has4 channels. G's dense16-to-64 stem has tanh, then reshape
and pixel RMS; G feature convolutions use LeakyReLU(.2) followed by pixel RMS.

| Stage | Alpha during fitting | G groups | D groups | Active values |
|---|---|---|---|---|
|0, stable4 |0 |0,1 |4,5 |1462 |
|1, fade8 |(step+1)/32 |0,1,2,3 |4,5,6,7 |2067 |
|2, stable8 |1 |0,2,3 |4,6,7 |2054 |

The last fade batch has alpha1 but still steps groups1 and5. Only the next stage
omits them. Every forward evaluates both branches, including at alpha0 and1.
An inactive group's parameters and optimizer counter stay unchanged; a zero
current derivative does not imply that an Adam step would leave it unchanged.

```{cpp, results="markdown", file="figures/progressive_activity.svg", flags="-std=c++23 -O2 $(pkg-config --cflags --libs datamunge) -Wl,-rpath,$(pkg-config --variable=libdir datamunge)"}
#include <dm/dm.hpp>
int main() {
  namespace n = dm::nn;
  std::vector<std::unique_ptr<n::ParameterStore>> stores;
  for (auto seed : {6401, 6407, 6413, 6421, 6427, 6449, 6451, 6469})
    stores.push_back(std::make_unique<n::ParameterStore>(seed));
  {
    n::NoGradGuard guard;
    n::models::ProgressiveGan(
        *stores[0],
        *stores[1],
        *stores[2],
        *stores[3],
        *stores[4],
        *stores[5],
        *stores[6],
        *stores[7],
        n::zeros({1, 8, 8, 1}),
        n::zeros({1, 16}),
        n::full({}, 0));
  }
  std::vector<double> batches, g, d;
  for (int k = 0; k < 96; ++k) {
    batches.push_back(k + 1);
    for (bool generator : {true, false}) {
      double count = 0;
      for (int group : n::models::ProgressiveActiveGroups(k / 32, generator))
        count += stores[group]->count();
      (generator ? g : d).push_back(count);
    }
  }
  auto p = dm::graphics::RPlot::create();
  p.y_limits(0, 2300)
      .lines(batches, g, "G active values", {37, 99, 235}, 2)
      .lines(batches, d, "D active values", {220, 38, 38}, 2)
      .x_label("Batch1-32 stable4;33-64 fade8;65-96 stable8")
      .y_label("Active scalar parameter values")
      .title("Stage activity selects independent optimizer writes")
      .save_svg("build/progressive_activity.svg");
}
```
