> Assess what the preserved run establishes

The fixed final test objectives are D=.34408068656921387 and
G=.6269638538360596. Single-versus-batch generation agrees exactly, all2067
restored values match their checkpoint, both invalid alpha controls are rejected,
and inference leaves every group unchanged. The saved galleries show weak patches;
there is no digit-quality metric, convergence claim or selection on the test set.

Independent NumPy forward/adjoint code checks180723 native parameter derivatives,
282436 forward values and66 representative final scalar finite differences.
It independently reproduces all576 Adam transitions bit exactly, including192
phase ownership checks and the eight final counters. The native library and this
complete report also reproduce all1343565 values in the eight frozen original
archives, all399 additional phase/probe archives and the source's non-timing
artifacts. These are arithmetic and schedule checks, not evidence of good samples.
The retained C++ program remains the executable source of its figures and outputs.
